1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,280
A synthetic change stream for Ruta Sur Logistics, a fictional shipper.

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:12,300
At-least-once delivery, idempotent state, and a stub agent that only prepares
notices. Offline.

3
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:22,190
Mixed faults, seed seven: eighty produced, fifty-nine applied, sixteen stale,
three duplicates skipped, two on the dead-letter queue.

4
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:27,910
Violations zero. Ten notices still pending human approval. Clock: simulated.

5
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:37,590
Gate on ten scenarios: no-loss, exactly-once effect, order, poison isolation,
and the rest. Violations: zero.

6
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:52,310
Disable idempotency on a duplicate burst: event evt-000001 applied five times.
Violations one. Exit one. That is the expected red.

7
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:58,890
A delayed premium shipment should become one notice, even when the event
arrives twice.

8
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:08,170
Not covered: Debezium, Postgres, Kafka in C-I, or a real send. Notices stay
pending until a named person approves.

9
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:14,610
Run python -m cdc_lab demo. Lab path cost: zero.

